Since I didn't see an answer to your question:  you need to set the size
before you actually telnet:  on the putty screen before you connect, on
the left there's a "Window" link - that has window size.  If you change
those numbers, NAO will use those settings.  Don't seem to stay changed,
tho...you'll have to play around with it - maybe saving a session after
changing it?

